---
title: Boiled Cookies
servings: 18
cookTime: 15 min
totalTime: 30 min
difficulty: Easy
source:
  name: Mom
tags: Desserts
---

Put @Sugar{2%cup}, @Cocoa{3%tbsp}, @Milk{1/2@cup}, @Butter{1/2@cup}, and @Peanut Butter{1/2@cup} in a pan. 

Bring to a hard boil for 1 minute. Remove from heat.

Add @Oatmeal{3%cups} and @Vanilla{1%tsp}. 

To make better mounded shapes, cool in the fridge 15 minutes. 

Drop in spoonfuls on wax paper. Cool completely.
